          "tz": 0
        },
        "subject": "LU-20973 tests: DO NOT LAND check subtest-change false FAIL",
        "message": "LU-20973 tests: DO NOT LAND check subtest-change false FAIL\n\nEvery review-dne(-zfs)-subtest-change session that loops a\nsanity-lnet subtest for ONLY_MINUTES=30 without a failure has been\nreported as a suite FAIL with no failed subtest.  On 70883 test_239\npassed 35/35 and 39/39 and the suites ended after ~1890 s.\n\nMake a comment-only change to sanity-lnet test_1, which only\nconfigures a peer locally, so the subtest-change sessions loop it on\nan otherwise unmodified master.  If they report FAIL with every repeat passing, the\nproblem is in the session, not in the tested change.  The custom\nsession repeats the same test for 20 minutes as a control.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nTest-Parameters: testlist=sanity-lnet env=ONLY=1,ONLY_MINUTES=20\nSigned-off-by: Jinshan Xiong <jinshanx@google.com>\nAssisted-by: Jetski:gemini-3.1-pro\nChange-Id: I7cfa29cf7a4bbde9be3e0c05c4133740b420ccc8\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
